]}_{1}^{3}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ({3}^{4}-{1}^{4})\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =20{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we integrate with respect to $\\theta :$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}20{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  & =20[\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{2}]_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =10{[{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ]}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =10({sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-{sin}^{2}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =10(1-0) \\\\  & =10\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332532 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332533 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332534 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332535 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332536 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1041 "selection" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332533 13194139535125 true] [17592186332531 1110 #uuid "ad30e96f-4217-54ce-9262-85db065517e3" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332532 1034 "20" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332532 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535125 true] [17592186332532 1111 #uuid "991e8489-55d7-5cb8-bae5-bde61d3ce0e6" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332533 1034 "10" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332533 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535125 true] [17592186332533 1111 #uuid "2e9855b2-6ead-50a0-bcac-4fc6a99978eb" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332534 1034 "40" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332534 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535125 true] [17592186332534 1111 #uuid "cb4d1b1a-e066-5a67-8b6d-2d63426ca663" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332535 1034 "30" 13194139535125 true] [17592186332535 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1319413953